    "The capture contains parts of several programs (a finance curriculum fragment, BS in General Studies, and a truncated BS in Gerontology and Aging Services); this ledger was drafted for BS in General Studies as the only program fully shown. Confirm the intended program.",
    "The 30-credit UMGC residency requirement for General Studies may be met in any combination of major, general education, and elective courses, so it is not tied to any single requirement; it is not reflected as institutionalOnly on any line.",
